<title>MALTA: SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT MALTA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPAIN BEAT MALTA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>TA'QALI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain beat Malta 3-0 (halftime</p>
<p>3-0) in a World Cup European group six soccer qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Guerrero 9, 26, 34</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p>Spain	     5   4   1   0   15   3   13</p>
<p>Yugoslavia	5   4   0   1   18   4   12</p>
<p>Slovakia	  4   3   0   1   12   5    9</p>
<p>Czech Republic  3   1   1   1    6   1    4</p>
<p>Faroe Islands   5   0   0   5    5  22    0</p>
<p>Malta	     4   0   0   4    0  21    0</p>
</text>
